{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 57181, "name": "Ben Cotton", "username": "bcotton", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/bcotton/{size}/28189_2.png", "created_at": "2021-12-17T22:05:06.426Z", "cooked": "<p><small>Originally published at:\t\t\t<a href=\"https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/fridays-fedora-facts-2021-50/\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Friday's Fedora Facts: 2021-50 – Fedora Community Blog</a><br>\n</small><br></p><p>Here’s your weekly Fedora report. Read what happened this week and what’s coming up. Your contributions are welcome (see the end of the post)!</p><p></p>\n<p>This will be the last Friday’s Fedora Facts for 2021. See you next year!</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#announcements\">Announcements</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#cfps\">Calls for Participation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#help-wanted\">Help wanted</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#upcoming-meetings\">Upcoming meetings</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#releases\">Releases</a></li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h2>Announcements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Taiga instance on teams.fedoraproject.org will be <a href=\"https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/retiring-taiga-instance-on-teams-fedoraproject-org/\">retired on 17 December</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/epel-9-is-now-available/\">EPEL 9 is now available</a></li>\n</ul><h3>CfPs</h3>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Conference</th>\n<th>Location</th>\n<th>Date</th>\n<th>CfP</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fosdem.org/2022/schedule/track/distributions/\">Distributions DevRoom @ FOSDEM</a></td>\n<td>virtual</td>\n<td>5–6 Feb</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://lists.fosdem.org/pipermail/fosdem/2021q4/003311.html\">closes 20 Dec</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://wiki.centos.org/Events/Dojo/FOSDEM2022\">CentOS Dojo @ FOSDEM</a></td>\n<td>virtual</td>\n<td>3–4 Feb</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://forms.gle/mwEUJ65xYYsCUnYo6\">closes 9 Jan</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.redhat.com/en/summit\">Red Hat Summit</a></td>\n<td>TBD</td>\n<td>late spring</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://reg.experiences.redhat.com/flow/redhat/sum22/CFP/login\">closes 5 Jan</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>Help wanted</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>331 <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/PackageReviewStatus/\">package review requests</a> are awaiting a reviewer</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/QN6AGKDQHH6F653K73WTQPYVKVBDIUPW/\">Orphaned packages</a> seeking maintainers</li>\n</ul><h3>Upcoming test days</h3>\n<h2>Prioritized Bugs</h2>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/program_management/prioritized_bugs/\">Prioritized Bugs documentation</a> for information on the process, including how to nominate bugs.</p>\n<h2>Releases</h2>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Release</th>\n<th>open bugs</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>F34</td>\n<td>5502</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F35</td>\n<td>2225</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F36 (rawhide)</td>\n<td>6818</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h3>Fedora Linux 36</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>273 packages <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?bug_status=__open__&amp;f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=1992484\">fail to build from source</a>\n</li>\n<li>79 packages <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?bug_status=__open__&amp;f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=1992487\">fail to install</a>\n</li>\n</ul><h4>Schedule</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>2021-12-22</strong> — Deadline for Change proposals that require infrastructure changes</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2021-12-28</strong> — Deadline for System-Wide Change proposals and proposals that require mass rebuild</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2022-01-18</strong> — Deadline for Self-Contained Change proposals</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2022-01-19</strong> — Mass rebuild begins</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2022-02-08</strong> — F36 branches from Rawhide; Rawhide begins F37 development</li>\n</ul><h4>Changes</h4>\n<p>The table below lists proposed Changes. See the <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Releases/36/ChangeSet\">ChangeSet page</a> or <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=F36Changes\">Bugzilla</a> for information on approved Changes.</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Proposal</th>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>Status</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/PostgreSQL_14\">PostgreSQL 14</a></td>\n<td>Self-Contained</td>\n<td>Approved</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/LXQt_1.0\">LXQt 1.0.0</a></td>\n<td>Self-Contained</td>\n<td>Approved</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Users_are_admins_by_default_in_Anaconda\">Users are administrators by default in the installer GUI.</a></td>\n<td>Self-Contained</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://pagure.io/fesco/issue/2708\">FESCo #2708</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/FsVerityRPM\">Enable fs-verity in RPM</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://pagure.io/fesco/issue/2711\">FESCo #2711</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/GnutlsAllowlisting\">Switch GnuTLS to allowlisting</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://pagure.io/fesco/issue/2712\">FESCo #2712</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/FixRescueMode\">Make Rescue Mode Work With Locked Root</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://pagure.io/fesco/issue/2713\">FESCo #2713</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/WaylandByDefaultOnNVIDIA\">Wayland By Default with NVIDIA proprietary Driver</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://pagure.io/fesco/issue/2714\">FESCo #2714</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/GHC_parallel_version_installs\">GHC compiler parallel version installs</a></td>\n<td>Self-Contained</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/YJICL2IQLQR3IBBLCX6EZYQ4INHFTEDJ/\">Announced</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Keylime_subpackaging_and_agent_alternatives\">Keylime subpackaging and agent alternatives</a></td>\n<td>Self-Contained</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/KRP7AF7PGQ3AKX5VFRGIU7OHUR52C3TE/\">Announced</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/golang1.18\">Golang 1.18</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/OXOGNSLTD7HEAZU5AAELMU4WKWALQA75/\">Announced</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/DIGLIM\">DIGLIM</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/J2UM2MGME2ZFRV7UTILUVDXCG6TS77JU/\">Announced</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>Contributing</h2>\n<p>Have something you want included? You can file an issue or submit a pull request in the <a href=\"https://pagure.io/fedora-pgm/pgm_communication\">fedora-pgm/pgm_communication repo</a>.</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 1, "updated_at": "2021-12-17T22:05:06.426Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 17, "reads": 31, "readers_count": 30, "score": 151.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 35311, "topic_slug": "fridays-fedora-facts-2021-50", "display_username": "Ben Cotton", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_